                                                                     Project Templates in Adobe Workfront

A Project Template is a reusable structure used to create projects with predefined tasks, durations, assignments, and other project details.

                                                                      what is project ?

A project is one defined piece of work with a start, an end, an owner and a set of tasks, tracked in Workfront from beginning to finish.
Project = one piece of work, with a goal, a timeline, people and tasks.
It is the place where work is actually planned and managed. Portfolios and programs only group projects together for reporting.


